Falsifies `extensible_host_controller_interface::verification::an_endpoint_context_keeps_each_field_in_its_own_bits`.

The defect: `endpoint` shifts the endpoint type one bit too far, so the type lands in bits 4 to 6 and the code read back from bits 3 to 5 is wrong.

Expected to fail: the harness's check that bits 3 to 5 of dword 1 hold the endpoint type's code.

diff --git a/src/context.rs b/src/context.rs
--- a/src/context.rs
+++ b/src/context.rs
@@ -117,7 +117,7 @@
     };
     [
         (interval as u32) << 16,
-        3 << 1 | (kind as u32) << 3 | (maximum_packet as u32) << 16,
+        3 << 1 | (kind as u32) << 4 | (maximum_packet as u32) << 16,
         dequeue as u32,
         (dequeue >> 32) as u32,
         average_transfer_request_block_bytes as u32 | maximum_service_interval_payload << 16,
